    "Scanne le QR code du kit ou tape ta Secret Key. Minuscules, espaces et tirets oubliés sont acceptés." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Scanne den QR-Code im Emergency Kit oder gib deinen Secret Key ein. Kleinbuchstaben, Leerzeichen und fehlende Bindestriche werden akzeptiert."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scan the kit's QR code or type your Secret Key. Lowercase letters, spaces and missing dashes are fine."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Escanea el código QR del kit o escribe tu Secret Key. Se aceptan minúsculas, espacios y guiones olvidados."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scansiona il codice QR del kit o digita la tua Secret Key. Minuscole, spazi e trattini dimenticati sono accettati."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "키트의 QR 코드를 스캔하거나 Secret Key를 입력해 주세요. 소문자나 공백이 있어도, 하이픈이 없어도 괜찮아요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "扫描工具包中的二维码，或输入你的 Secret Key。可使用小写字母、空格，也可省略连字符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
